<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ to tender NZ$150 mln of 2009 govt bonds.</title>
<headline>RBNZ to tender NZ$150 mln of 2009 govt bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday it would offer NZ$150 million of of July 2009 bonds with a coupon of seven percent at a tender on August 7.</p>
<p>Bids close 11.30 a.m. (2330 GMT), results will be announced at 1 p.m. and settlement is August 12 .</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
